
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Empty : Magazine ammo == 0
    Idle --> Shoot : Trigger pressed and build-up time == 0
    Idle --> BuildUp : Trigger pressed and build-up time > 0
    Idle --> Reload : Reload pressed, magazine not full, reserve ammo available

    Shoot --> WaitForTriggerRelease : Rate-of-fire event; burst exhausted or magazine empty
    Shoot --> WaitForTriggerRelease : Rate-of-fire event; trigger released

    WaitForTriggerRelease --> ManualCockingRequired : Debounce event; trigger stably released, ammo available, manual cocking enabled
    WaitForTriggerRelease --> Idle : Debounce event; trigger stably released, ammo available, manual cocking disabled
    WaitForTriggerRelease --> Empty : Debounce event; trigger stably released, magazine empty

    Empty --> Reload : Reload pressed and reserve ammo available

    Reload --> CountedReload : Counted reload enabled
    Reload --> Cocking : Magazine-insert timer event; complete reload

    Cocking --> Empty : Magazine ammo == 0
    Cocking --> Idle : Cocking-time event

    BuildUp --> Shoot : Build-up-time event
    BuildUp --> Idle : Trigger released before build-up completes

    ManualCockingRequired --> Cocking : Reload switch pressed

    CountedReload --> Empty : Magazine + reserve ammo == 0
    CountedReload --> Cocking : Round-insert timer event; magazine full or reserve ammo exhausted

    note right of Shoot
        Entry fires the first shot.
        Subsequent shots are paced by
        RateOfFireEvent.
        Burst count below zero means full auto.
    end note

    note right of WaitForTriggerRelease
        TriggerDebounce is acted on only
        after the debounce timer has elapsed.
    end note

    note right of Reload
        Non-counted reload waits for
        MagInsertTime. Counted reload
        moves immediately to CountedReload.
    end note

    note right of CountedReload
        Each timer event inserts one round.
        If more rounds can be inserted,
        the state remains CountedReload.
        Otherwise it transitions to Cocking.
    end note
